  "structure": {
    "block_count": 39,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "The Best Baby Deals: Early Mother's Day Sales For Easy Gifting",
        "text_sha256": "845774405715bd7793d319f361fd510b186c13106d9bff91bbe1a88141b10a53",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Best baby deals of the week collage featuring Beyond yoga leggings, baby brezza bottle washer, mint & lily bracelet, diapers, and needed prenatal powder",
        "text_sha256": "a4a3606e68d9dad6fa7fc032e0db3ab14a2de5cb6dd78c87f5112a7d7dc0dac1",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Score early Mother's Day deals on clothes, skincare, and other mom treats.",
        "text_sha256": "68c32f10113e9bd64dce84a1da457c16c84a28385cf7083d669b225416a78189",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Just so you know, What to Expect may earn commissions from the shopping links included on this page. All sales and prices are accurate at the time of publishing.",
        "text_sha256": "1922c3fea76d4f2a6f4ade63feb42972a2bb42e22c26d8117381d8356cd35012",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "As nice as it is to save on baby gear, you can’t always hold out for Prime Day or Black Friday . After all, your baby needs diapers now. But after a decade covering sales, I can tell you there is almost always a baby deal — you just have to know where to look.",
        "text_sha256": "3c0969fad5897f7ef6303e44a4122f90a54d0281f984a0ff1148c89849092c77",
        "word_count": 55
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "With Mother's Day approaching this weekend, plenty of brands are helping out the procrasinators, offering discounts on mom-loved clothes, skincare, and more. This way, you can grab a last-minute Mother's Day gift that looks thoughtful and doesn't break the bank. And if you're trying to save on those baby care essentials, don't worry. Amazon, Target, and Walmart has deals on the items you reach for daily.",
        "text_sha256": "09d457ed97e4da88dd016a23c543ebe54c8f4aa8e3e1ad0886c9a1fad370652b",
        "word_count": 66
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here, I’ve rounded up the best baby deals for parents. Whether you are buying ahead, replacing something that did not work out, or trying something an influencer recommended, using these curated discounts can save you money.",
        "text_sha256": "812b380b79112f8198391c83bb72386bc082e449f20de277c537dec8619625af",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Bookmark this page and check back often for new price drops and noteworthy baby sales.",
        "text_sha256": "e82edf2843333d29b6257164007b59510d06a09975b3ca7147a2be8c3542b477",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Mother's Day Gift Deals",
        "text_sha256": "d3b8a11b99d39c6f98925ae6120692aafeccca5d990014fceaef06c55eaf4e3c",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Mint & Lily : Stumped on gift ideas? This WTE-loved brand creates quality, customizable jewelry that doesn’t cost a fortune. Right now, use code WTE25 to save 25% on Mint & Lily orders.",
        "text_sha256": "f3c29e1425d35c7c1bb93c93ef42ee4932336d8b989e13096fee63c8642d86bd",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Alo : A mom can't have too many leggings, and right now you can save 30% on leggings (and more) from Alo durring the Aloversary Sale.",
        "text_sha256": "fbbd164ec5052077503f71cc968687a7b20534d286baf0d4cf32168895e55f8c",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Athleta : Need more legging options or just some additional athliesure? Athleta is offering 40% off summer must-haves.",
        "text_sha256": "6bbb94c94b540ce3f22771b19d75c2c71c5c6c7d8eb540ab1b05db6aacbcf4a2",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Birkenstocks : Ready to swap your boots for sandals? Select Birkenstock styles, including the three-strapped Florida Sandal and the classic Arizona Droplet Buckle Slide , are up to 35% off at Nordstrom.",
        "text_sha256": "1ce6d045e6875b5418d90151cf1c0ac2daf46894000f44520923568bd7aa0389",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Caraa : Totes? Crossbodies? Diaper bags? Whatever your need, Caara is offering 20% off a curated collection of stylish bags.",
        "text_sha256": "4bb47a3a897993268df4e9151caa574684f7064058e6ef210b3e5d0176c780f9",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The Baby Baby Deals: May 6, 2026",
        "text_sha256": "188d2a1099fcebf1c8ea30cdb89062dfc1fd041fde1e375db86da76ea7ce415b",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Diapers: Target's popular diaper deal is back! Get a $15 gift card when you spend $75 on diapers and wipes from Huggies, Pampers, and other favorite brands.",
        "text_sha256": "b6f03bd8bda89e1a8acece4d7cff3d9e52682774ee32ae7746fc21a6b76e3227",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Pregnancy- and Kid-Safe Sunscreen : Amazon's Summer Beauty Event is the perfect time to stock up on SPF so you're not scrambling come beach day. Right now, you can save up to 40% on sunscreen from Sun Bum , EltaMD , Coola , and more.",
        "text_sha256": "f8fe9018fc2ac3338ab61d514633c6e8fc0ef0af3368a3666aafcfbb930a39c4",
        "word_count": 45
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Bodily : Save up to 40% on Bodily's line of super comfy (and super supportive) nursing bras and postpartum clothing.",
        "text_sha256": "39ad578c1eda133d42a3ed7b4ddb23202462cb9ff687f637c50e4a8190e59c56",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Baby Brezza : Save 22% on Baby Brezza's innovative gear that takes the elbow grease out of cleaning, sterilizing, and warming bottles.",
        "text_sha256": "d284ff2f0c32a36af09a0c7e8638f8c9664b012d04ab7a51d336d2d95d7efb70",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Motif : Shopping for a primary pump or wearable option? Motif has plenty of hospital-grade options — all up to 20% off right now.",
        "text_sha256": "89461ba9c5be3befca2a2dc8d4aba3720205f9ec1ae2b812711246576014d6bb",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Skechers : If bending down is already getting tricky, these easy slip-ons moms-to-be in the WTE community swear by (plus lots of cute toddler styles) are BOGO 50% off right now.",
        "text_sha256": "3c314181a05b3dd7d005f06cb7dc0e20cc258cd790f9d912840413c06e3144c4",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Your Next Read",
        "text_sha256": "6d2b65f6bc74d3f3d5656d8c88c806ff70605a0ce9d4fd990efe9af093220755",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
